Third-Party Notices
===================

Rust crate licenses live in each crate's own package metadata, not in this
repository's Cargo.toml. They can be collected from Cargo.lock.

This file lists third-party material that Cargo does not see: IBM Plex and
typograf are in the repository; libmpv is fetched at Windows build time;
the Android app's Java libraries are fetched by Gradle.

